So again, the proof essentially is you have to show that the rotations in Gamma-bar have order 1, 2, 3, 4, or 6, because if you have a dihedral group you will have rotations of order n, right? D_{2n} has a rotation of order n.

14
00:03:44,980 --> 00:03:46,930
所以如果有一个旋转，我只需对旋转进行分类。
So if I have a rotation, I just have to classify that.

15
00:03:46,930 --> 00:04:13,844
我来看 gamma 的特征多项式：它形如 x平方——好吧，我写成这样：x^2 - 2 cos(theta) x + 1。这就是特征多项式，其中 theta 是旋转角。
And I look at the characteristic polynomial of gamma: it looks like x squared—well, I'll write it like this: x^2 - 2 cos(theta) x + 1. So there's the characteristic polynomial, where theta is the angle of rotation.

16
00:04:13,844 --> 00:04:27,136
所以这个数无论是什么，其绝对值都小于等于 2，因为 |cos(theta)| <= 1，故 |2 cos(theta)| <= 2。
So this number, whatever it is, is in absolute value less than or equal to 2, because |cos(theta)| <= 1, so |2 cos(theta)| <= 2.

17
00:04:27,136 --> 00:04:45,878
在另一方面，由于 Gamma 保持该点阵不变，我们可以写出 gamma 关于该点阵基 a 和 b 的矩阵，这个 2x2 矩阵具有整数矩阵元：
On the other hand, since Gamma preserves this lattice, we can write down a matrix of gamma with respect to the basis a and b of this lattice, and the 2x2 matrix has integer entries:

18
00:04:45,878 --> 00:05:11,957
gamma 关于基 {a, b} 的矩阵 A 是整系数的，不仅是实数，而且具有整数矩阵元，因为它把 a 映为 a 的整数倍加上 b 的整数倍，对 b 亦然。因此它的迹是整数，整迹！
the matrix A of gamma with respect to the basis {a, b} is integral, it doesn't just have real entries, it has integer entries, because it takes a to an integer multiple of a plus an integer multiple of b, and similarly for b. Therefore its trace is an integer, an integral trace!

19
00:05:11,957 --> 00:05:26,850
所以无论这个角是多少，2 cos(theta) 都是 -2 到 2 之间的某个整数。-2 到 2 之间只有五个整数：-2、-1、0、1、2。
So therefore, whatever this angle is, 2 cos(theta) is some number between -2 and 2 which is an integer. There are only five integers between -2 and 2: -2, -1, 0, 1, 2.

20
00:05:26,850 --> 00:05:44,889
而一旦我知道 2 cos(theta) 是什么——2 cos(theta) 是 -2、-1、0、1 或 2，这就确定了 cos(theta) 的值：
And once I know what 2 cos(theta) is, 2 cos(theta) is -2, -1, 0, 1, or 2, and that tells me what cos(theta) is: -1, -1/2, 0, 1/2, and 1.

21
00:05:44,889 --> 00:05:56,121
-1、-1/2、0、1/2 和 1。由此我就知道了旋转角，正好得到这五个角度！这就是关于只能出现这些阶数的证明。
Once I know that, I know what the angle is, and you find exactly these five angles! So that's the proof that you get those.

