That will be the end of this: so L up to the action of O(2) and R^x. Well, we know that the lattice has a shortest vector, right?

33
00:09:04,050 --> 00:09:11,870
因为如果点阵中存在任意接近原点的向量，它就不是点阵了；点阵向量之间彼此有正距离下界。
Because if there were vectors in the lattice arbitrarily close to the origin, this wouldn't be a lattice; the vectors are bounded away from each other.

34
00:09:11,870 --> 00:09:36,078
