And then, using SO(2), you rotate a so that this vector of length 1 is actually equal to the vector 1. So by scaling my lattice and by rotating my shortest vector, I can assume that the shortest vector is the number 1.

37
00:10:05,518 --> 00:10:07,149
好的，大家都同意吧？
Okay, everybody agree?

38
00:10:07,149 --> 00:10:27,069
我做的第一件事是缩放点阵，让最短向量落在单位圆上，然后我有一个唯一的旋转把它转到实轴上的 1，使得最短向量为 1。我们手头还剩下一个反射，并且我手头还剩下正负号可以使用。
The first thing I do is I scale it, the shortest vector is on the unit circle, and then I have a unique rotation putting that vector on the circle so that the shortest vector has length 1. I still have a reflection left, and I still have ±1 left to work with.

39
00:10:27,069 --> 00:10:34,280
好的，现在点阵的第二个向量在哪里？首先，第二个向量必须位于该单位圆的外部（或圆周上），设该向量为 b。
Okay, now where is the second vector of the lattice? Well, first of all, the second vector has to be outside of this circle, let's say the vector b.

40
00:10:40,310 --> 00:10:47,027
我们知道的第一件事是：b 的模长 |b| 必须至少为 1，好的？
The first thing we know: the absolute value of b has to be at least 1, okay?

41
00:10:47,027 --> 00:10:51,310
因此它落在单位圆外部。
And so it lies outside the circle.

42
00:10:51,310 --> 00:11:07,582
我们还可以把 b 替换为 -b，这生成相同的子群：Z a + Z b 完全一样，并确保其虚部为正。
And we can also replace b by -b, which gives the same subgroup: Z a + Z b is the same thing, and make sure the imaginary part is positive.

43
00:11:07,582 --> 00:11:25,310
我们知道它的虚部是非零的，也就是说它的第二坐标，即 y 坐标是非零的，因为如果 y 坐标为零，它就与 a 线性相关了，但我们知道 a与 b 线性无关。
We know its imaginary part is non-zero, that is, its second coordinate, the y-coordinate, is non-zero, because if the y-coordinate were zero, it would be linearly dependent with a, but we know a and b are linearly independent.

44
00:11:25,310 --> 00:11:30,110
所以无论 b 是什么，它要么落在上方，要么落在下方，但绝不在水平轴上。
So whatever b is, it's either going to lie up here or below here, but it's not on this line.

45
00:11:30,110 --> 00:11:48,611
所以通过在必要时用 -b 替换，我们可以假定 y 坐标为正。所以它位于……它落在上半平面单位圆外的某个地方。
So by replacing it by -b, we can assume that the y-coordinate is positive. So it's in this... it's outside of the circle up here somewhere.

46
00:11:48,611 --> 00:12:01,453
