And finally, we get the same subgroup—so this doesn't affect what subgroup we're really interested in—we can also replace b by an integer multiple of a, and we'll still get the same subgroup.

47
00:12:01,453 --> 00:12:12,060
所以通过加减 a 的整数倍平移 b，使其 x 坐标落在 1/2 与-1/2 之间。
So replace b by a multiple of a to shift it back, so that its x-coordinate lies between 1/2 and minus a half (-1/2).

48
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:39,572
