Okay, now there are two very special points of this region: namely, this point here and this point here, sort of boundary points of the region.

69
00:16:50,814 --> 00:17:00,932
如果你取 b 为这里的这个点，那么你就得到了一个极其著名的点阵：它形如这样：模长为 1，夹角为 60 度。
And if you take b to be this point here, then you get a very famous lattice: it looks like this: length 1, at an angle of 60 degrees.

70
00:17:00,932 --> 00:17:17,461
你可以算出单位圆与垂直线相交处的这个点对应 60 度角，然后你拥有这些向量，围绕原点有六个具有相同长度（长度均为 1）的向量。这就是著名的正六边形点阵（六角点阵）！
You can figure out that this point is at 60 degrees where the circle meets the line, and then you have these vectors, and there are six vectors around the origin that have the same length—the same length 1. This is the famous hexagonal lattice!

71
00:17:17,461 --> 00:17:30,274
如果你用这个点阵来密铺，就相当于在每个点阵点上放置一个半径为 1/2 的圆盘，使得这些圆盘刚好彼此相切：
If you use this lattice, the packing is like putting a sphere in each... putting a circle at each lattice point of radius 1/2, so that the circles just touch each other:

72
00:17:30,274 --> 00:17:47,497
这就得到了二维空间中的最优密堆积！如果你排布圆盘，这种方式覆盖了二维空间的最大比例。但是围绕原点有六个圆盘——六个！
one gets the best packing of two-dimensional space! If you arrange with circles, this covers the most of two-dimensional space. But there are six circles—six!

73
00:17:47,497 --> 00:17:51,630
